joedb provides CMake targets:

    find_package(joedb CONFIG REQUIRED)
    target_link_libraries(main PRIVATE joedb::joedb)

The joedbc schema compiler is available as an imported executable target:

    add_custom_command(
        OUTPUT generated.cpp
        COMMAND joedb::joedbc database
        DEPENDS joedb::joedbc database.joedbi database.joedbc
    )
